{"id":"msg_m_ex_scouting_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_scouting","label":"The Scouts · Group"},"label":"4. Commanderr!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_event_fullfoolday_02","next":"msg_m_ex_scouting_04","speakers":{"signal":"Signal","delta":"Delta"},"icons":{"signal":"si_c022_00_s","delta":"si_c020_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_1","text":"Commanderr!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_2","text":"Ddelta!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_3","text":"There's something I've gotta tell you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_4","text":"You seem awfully flustered.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_5","text":"It must be an emergency.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_6","text":"Awaiting your orders, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_7","text":"We'll provide an urgent support request if necessary.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_8","text":"Pump the brakes, Delta.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_9","text":"Yes, Sir!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_10","text":"We'll stand by until orders are given.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_11","text":"It's not what you think, Delta.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_12","text":"It's an emergency,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_13","text":"but it's got nothing to do with battle.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_14","text":"Then what is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_15","text":"I'm not detecting any enemy presence,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_16","text":"but we'll maintain combat readiness for the time being, regardless.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_17","text":"Out with it, Signal.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_18","text":"Yes, Sir!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_19","text":"Last time, when Delta...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_20","text":"You mean me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_21","text":"Yes, who else? When you came back from conducting recon upon the surface,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_22","text":"you brought me a little seed, remember?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_23","text":"Oh, yeah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_24","text":"A what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_25","text":"A seed!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_26","text":"I'm positive that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_27","text":"it only exists up on the surface.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_28","text":"When she gave it to me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_29","text":"she proposed that I plant it and watch how it progressed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_30","text":"So, how'd it go?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_31","text":"At first, nothing was happening.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_32","text":"I figured maybe it could only grow up on the surface.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_33","text":"But then one day, I woke up, and there was a little sprout!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_34","text":"It's budded?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_35","text":"Yeah, and it's adorable!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_36","text":"I'm sorry, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_37","text":"I didn't think it would actually sprout, and I acted without previous authorization.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_38","text":"We have acted in violation of the Ark's laws, having illegally smuggled in plant-based contraband and cultivated it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_39","text":"Signal and I are willing to accept any punishment you mete out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_40","text":"Ah","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_41","text":"Uh-oh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_42","text":"It's okay. There's no problem.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_43","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_44","text":"Really?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_45","text":"But what if the top brass find out about this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_46","text":"Won't you get in trouble, Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_47","text":"It happened in the Outpost, so it's entirely under my jurisdiction.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_48","text":"So that means...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_49","text":"You have to let me see it sometime.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_50","text":"No problem!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"signal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_51","text":"I'll take good care of it and make it grow big and strong!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_52","text":"And Delta.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_53","text":"Yes, Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_54","text":"It's thanks to you that we were able to retrieve a living plant from the surface.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_55","text":"Oh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_56","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_57","text":"You're welcome.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_scouting_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_scouting_03_58","text":"I'll try and keep up the good work.","jump":null}],"chat":true}